</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">対談</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对谈；对话；交谈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208987\">その<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、ある<ruby>大学教授<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがくきょうじゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>対談<rp>(</rp><rt>たいだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">此外,我们还需要与大学教授交谈。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">たいてい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大多；通常；一般；往往；大概；或许；大部分；几乎全部；平常；普通；恰当；适度；得体</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79711\"><ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたいていの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">夜晚是大多数人睡觉的时候。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">対等</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">平等；同等地位；对等条件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231971\">あなたは<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>対等<rp>(</rp><rt>たいとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>より<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>した</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你和我平等,不低于我,也不高于我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">タイトル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">标题；题目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206701\">その<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のタイトルは<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书的标题是什么?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">態度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">态度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>態度<rp>(</rp><rt>たいど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的态度突然变了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">滞納</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逾期未付；拖欠；欠缴；违约；滞纳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>"]